   "subject": "Re: Shiny withProgress bar css style",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">I think you should be using something like this:<div><br></div><div>.shiny-progress .progress-text {<br></div><div>   ....</div><div>}</div><div><br></div><div>See the source CSS here:</div><div><a href=\"https://github.com/rstudio/shiny/blob/515a67a/inst/www/shared/shiny.css#L94-L114\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/rstudio/shiny/blob/515a67a/inst/www/shared/shiny.css%23L94-L114&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792389223060000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2uKu5sgLVOUacUkARBWsvA\">https://github.com/rstudio/shiny/blob/515a67a/inst/www/shared/shiny.css#L94-L114</a><br></div></div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div class=\"gmail_extra\"><div class=\"gmail_quote\">On Fri, May 22, 2015 at 10:18 AM, Tianwei Zhang <span dir=\"ltr\">&lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">zhangtia...@gmail.com</a>&gt;</span> wrote:<br></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div class=\"gmail_extra\"><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">Hi,<div><br></div><div>The shiny progress bar is a nice feature, but I am wondering if we can change the style of the message box through css. Currently I have</div><div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">shiny</span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#000\">progress </span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  <br>  top</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">50</span><span style=\"color:#660\">%</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">!</span><span style=\"color:#000\">important</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  left</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">50</span><span style=\"color:#660\">%</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">!</span><span style=\"color:#000\">important</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  margin</span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#000\">top</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#066\">100px</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">!</span><span style=\"color:#000\">important</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  margin</span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#000\">left</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#066\">250px</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">!</span><span style=\"color:#000\">important</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br><br>  color</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#800\">#020202;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  font</span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#000\">size</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">18px</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  background</span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#000\">color</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#800\">#020202;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  text</span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#000\">align</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> center</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">}</span></div></code></div><div>But it does not change the background of the message box. If someone can point me to the right place for all the customization options, that will be really great. </div></div><div><br></div><div>Thank you. </div></div></blockquote></div></div>"
    ],
