     "<div class=\"gmail_extra\"><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">Hi, <div>how can I change the color of the actual bar? I am new to CSS but could see that the bar is the class &quot;active&quot;. I would like for example to change it to &quot;success&quot;. Is that possible at all?</div><div><br></div><div>Thank you<br><br>On Friday, 22 May 2015 18:07:48 UTC+2, Winston Chang  wrote:<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">I think you should be using something like this:<div><br></div><div>.shiny-progress .progress-text {<br></div><div>   ....</div><div>}</div><div><br></div><div>See the source CSS here:</div><div><a href=\"https://github.com/rstudio/shiny/blob/515a67a/inst/www/shared/shiny.css#L94-L114\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/rstudio/shiny/blob/515a67a/inst/www/shared/shiny.css%23L94-L114&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792389223067000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0swRK-w3OFeaz-0xo1AqsT\">https://github.com/rstudio/shiny/blob/515a67a/inst/www/shared/shiny.css#L94-L114</a><br></div></div><div><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\">On Fri, May 22, 2015 at 10:18 AM, Tianwei Zhang <span dir=\"ltr\">&lt;<a rel=\"nofollow\">zhangtia...@gmail.com</a>&gt;</span> wrote:<br><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">Hi,<div><br></div><div>The shiny progress bar is a nice feature, but I am wondering if we can change the style of the message box through css. Currently I have</div><div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">shiny</span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#000\">progress </span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  <br>  top</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">50</span><span style=\"color:#660\">%</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">!</span><span style=\"color:#000\">important</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  left</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">50</span><span style=\"color:#660\">%</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">!</span><span style=\"color:#000\">important</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  margin</span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#000\">top</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#066\">100px</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">!</span><span style=\"color:#000\">important</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  margin</span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#000\">left</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#066\">250px</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">!</span><span style=\"color:#000\">important</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br><br>  color</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#800\">#020202;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  font</span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#000\">size</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">18px</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  background</span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#000\">color</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#800\">#020202;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  text</span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#000\">align</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> center</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">}</span></div></code></div><div>But it does not change the background of the message box. If someone can point me to the right place for all the customization options, that will be really great. </div></div><div><br></div><div>Thank you. </div></div><span><font color=\"#888888\"><span><font color=\"#888888\">\r\n\r\n<p></p>\r\n\r\n-- <br>\r\nYou received this message because you are subscribed to the Google Groups &quot;Shiny - Web Framework for R&quot; group.<br>\r\nTo unsubscribe from this group and stop receiving emails from it, send an email to <a rel=\"nofollow\">shiny-discus...@googlegroups.com</a>.<br>\r\nTo view this discussion on the web visit <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/d/msgid/shiny-discuss/551b00de-d3a3-4b1a-9b14-dee003f449e7%40googlegroups.com?utm_medium=email&amp;utm_source=footer\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/d/msgid/shiny-discuss/551b00de-d3a3-4b1a-9b14-dee003f449e7%2540googlegroups.com?utm_medium%3Demail%26utm_source%3Dfooter&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792389223067000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0wdQO8zJWDkcIdZ5iwKBLv\">https://groups.google.com/d/msgid/shiny-discuss/551b00de-d3a3-4b1a-9b14-dee003f449e7%40googlegroups.com</a>.<br>\r\nFor more options, visit <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/d/optout\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/d/optout&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust